  "ruleText": "Emp 404.22 Failure to Comply. Failure to comply with the rules governing reimbursement of funds shall result in non-reimbursement until compliance is achieved.\n\nSource. #12960, INTERIM, eff 12-26-19, EXPIRED: 6-23-20\n\nNew. #13074, eff 7-22-20",
